000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TINVVAL.
000400 AUTHOR.              KURT MOVSESIAN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        MAR 4,1981.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*REMARKS.             INVENTORY VALUATION PROGRAM.
000900*
001000*    *********************************************************
001100*    **                                                     **
001200*    **                  APRIL 19, 1982                     **
001300*    **  ALL THE PLANTS VERSION (RATHER THAN JUST AKRON)    **
001400*    **                                                     **
001500*    *********************************************************
001600*
001700*    ON MARCH 3, 1982, THIS PROGRAM WAS SPLIT INTO 2 VERSIONS -
001800*    ONE FOR AKRON & ONE FOR THE PLANTS.  THE AKRON VERSION
001900*    ALLOWS THE USER TO CHOOSE BETWEEN SEEING ALL ITEMS, RAW
002000*    MATERIALS ONLY, OR ALL ITEMS EXCEPT RAW MATERIALS.  IT
002100*    ALSO WILL ALLOW THE USER TO OMIT ANY ITEMS WITH 0 ONHAND
002200*    IF HE WISHES.     CIH.
002300*
002400*    ON APRIL 19, 1982, SEVERAL CHANGES WERE MADE.  THE PRIMARY
002500*    BIN LOCATION WAS ADDED TO THE REPORT.  IN ORDER TO ADD
002600*    THIS FIELD, THE CORP CODE DESCRIPTION WAS DECREASED IN SIZE
002700*    FROM 77 TO 60 IN LENGTH.  ALSO, A CORRECTION WAS MADE TO
002800*    THE LOGIC WHEN A USER DEPRESSES THE "f8" KEY WITHOUT COM-
002900*    PLETING ANY PROCESSING.  PREVIOUSLY, THIS ACTION WOULD PRINT
003000*    AN ERROR MESSAGE TO PAPER AS WELL AS TO THE CONSOLE.  LMB.
003100*
003200*    ALSO, ON APRIL 19, 1982, AN INTRISIC "COMMAND" STATEMENT WAS
003300*    ADDED.  THIS DISALLOWS THE USER TO KICK OFF SEVERAL "R11"
003400*    REPORTS IN A ROW (WHICH CAUSED PROBLEMS SINCE EACH STREAM
003500*    CONTAINED A PURGE OF THE FILE STATEMENT NEEDED FROM
003600*    THE MODES PROGRAM.)  THIS STOPS THE PROBLEM OF SEVERAL PARTIAL
003700*    REPORTS.  LMB.
003800*
003900*    IN MAY, 1982, THE FOLLOWING CHANGES WERE MADE:
004000*       1.  THE USER MAY NOW SPECIFY IN THE PRE-PROCESSING PGM
004100*           WHAT SORT KEY HE WANTS.  THESE INCLUDE SORTING BY
004200*           CORPORATE CODE WITHIN CLASS, CORPORATE CODE, KEYWORD/
004300*           ADJECTIVE, OR PRIMARY BIN LOCATION.
004400*
004500*       2.  THE USER MAY NOW ASK FOR A PRINTOUT WITH INVENTORY
004600*           VALUES, OR HE MAY SPECIFY THE REPORT BE AN INV.
004700*           WORKSHEET, WITH DOTTED LINES TO FILL IN INV. VALUES.
004800*           CIH.
004900*
005000*    ON SEPT 26, 1983, CHANGED THE "INVENTORY WORKSHEET" OPTION
005100*    TO PRINT ALL LOCATIONS FOR EACH CODE.  CIH.
005200*
005300*    ON NOV 7, 1983, ADDED A MULTIPLE LINES OF DESCRIPTION
005400*    CAPABILITY TO THE PROGRAM.  THE USER HAS THE CHOICE OF
005500*    MULTIPLE LINES OR ONLY A SINGLE LINE IN THE PRE-PROCESSING
005600*    PROGRAM.  CIH.
005700*
005800*    ON OCT. 25, 1984, ADDED A "MATERIAL OPTION" TO SELECT ONLY
005900*    THOSE ITEMS ON A BLANKET ORDER.  WHILE MAKING THIS CHANGE,
006000*    ALSO PUT IN THE NEW METHOD OF COMMUNICATION BETWEEN THE
006100*    ON-LINE OPTION PROGRAM AND THE BATCH REPORT PROGRAM.
006200*    THIS NEW METHOD HAS THE OPTION PROGRAM CREATING THE JOB
006300*    STREAM INTERACTIVELY AS A TEMPORY FILE, AND THEN STREAMING
006400*    THE JOB USING THE COMMAND INTRINSIC.  THE REPORT PROGRAM
006500*    WILL THEN "ACCEPT" THE OPTION DATA, WHICH IS PUT INTO THE
006600*    JOB STREAM BY THE OPTION PROGRAM.  CIH.
006700*
006800*    ON NOVEMBER 8, 1984, CHANGED THIS REPORT TO USE
006900*    A RANGE OF VALUES ON SELECTION OPTIONS RATHER THAN
007000*    SELECT BY ENTERING UP TO 5 INDIVIDUAL VALUES.  FOR
007100*    EXAMPLE, IN THE OLD VERSION THE USER COULD SELECT UP
007200*    TO 5 ACCOUNTING CLASSES TO APPEAR ON THE REPORT.  NOW,
007300*    THE USER CAN SELECT A RANGE OF ACCOUNTING CLASSES TO
007400*    APPEAR ON THE REPORT.  ALSO, A SELECTION OPTION ON
007500*    KEYWORD ADJECTIVE AND ON MAJOR BIN LOCATION WAS ADDED.
007600*    CIH.
007700*
007800*    ON NOVEMBER 12, 1984, ADD A NEW OPTION FIELD TO ALLOW THE
007900*    USER TO SELECT THE VALUATION USING MARKET COST INSTEAD OF
008000*    AVERAGE COST. IF HE PUTS AN 'X' IN THE FIELD USE THE
008100*    MARKET COST, ELSE USE AVERAGE COST.
008200*    CAK.
008300*
008400*    ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROUTINE "TDATECHK" ON
008500*    MAY 17, 1985.   V.W.D.
008600*
008700*    ON JANUARY 31,1987 THE FOLLOWING HAS BEEN CHANGED OR ADDED:
008800*      1. THE REPORT OPTIONS WILL NOW BE COBOL "ACCEPT"ED FROM
008900*         PROGRAM "TRSCREEN" RATHER THAN READ IN FROM A FILE
009000*         THAT WAS CREATED BY THE PRE-PROCESSING PROGRAM
009100*         "TR11MODE". TR11MODE IS NO LONGER IN USE.
009200*      2. ADDED HEADER PAGE TO THE REPORT USING SUBPROGRAM
009300*         THDPRT2.
009400*      3. A CALL TO SUBPROGRAM "CDESC" TO GET FULL DESCRIPTION
009500*         IF REQUESTED.
009600*      4. ADDED COPYLIB, AS NEEDED, FOR ALL DATA SET BUFFER DESC.
009700*      5. REPLACED CALLS TO DBEXPLAIN WITH CALL TO "TBLOWUP"
009800*      6. CHANGED COPY STATEMENTS TO "IN COPYLIB".
009900*      7. ADDED NON-HP LOGIC.
010000*      8. PRINT COMPRESSION FEATURE.
010100*      9. ADDED REPORT TO DRPTDEF.PUB       C.J.R.
010200*
010300*
      *    IN MARCH 1994 OPTIONS TO RETRIEVE, SORT AND PRINT BY
      *      MANUFACTURER AND DEFAULT DEPARTMENT WERE ADDED PER
      *      REQUEST 6478 AND/OR PROGRAMMING REQUEST 94-003
      *
      *
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  17NOV1995    DAVE PLUM
      *C   N O T E: THERE HAVE BEEN NUMEROUS CHANGES MADE TO THIS
      *C            PROGRAM BETWEEN 23 JUNE 1994 AND 17 NOVEMBER 1995
      *C            WHICH ARE NOT DOCUMENTED HERE FOR SOME REASON.
      *C   ATTEMPTED TO CORRECT A PROBLEM WITH REPORTS USING SORT
      *C   OPTION = "7" (DEFAULT DEPT).  THESE REPORTS WERE PRINTING
      *C   SUBTOTAL LINES READING "TOTAL ITEMS FOR CLASS ...".
      *C   REVISED PARAGRAPH 833-BOTTOM-LINE TO CHECK FOR SORT OPTION
      *C   "7" INSTEAD OF MATERIAL OPTION "7" WHEN IT DETERMINES HOW
      *C   THE THESE SUBTOTAL LINES SHOULD READ.
      *C
      *C  09/12/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   RECOMPILE TO PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  08/04/1997   CA YODER     REQ #95-015
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM TO ACCEPT AND USE THE NEW OPTIONS ADDED
      *C    TO THE MATERIALS CONTROL REPORTS.
      *C    NOTE:  THIS PROGRAM NOW USES COPYLIB MEMBERS FOR MOST OF
      *C           ITS PROCESSING LOGIC.  TO SEE ALL OF THE MEMBERS,
      *C           LOOK IN COPYLIB FOR THE FILES THAT START WITH THE
      *C           PREFIX "MTLS".
      *C
      *C  06/05/98     JE COFFMAN
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO REMOVE FRANCHISED INVENTORIES FROM THE
      *C    ONHAND QUANTITIES AS THESE INVENTORIES ARE NOT REALLY
      *C    GOODYEAR'S UNTIL THEY ARE WITHDRAWN FROM THE STOREROOM.
      *C
      *C  09JUL1998   DAVE PLUM
      *C    RECOMPILED TO PICK UP CHANGES IN COPYLIB MEMBER MTLSINPT.
      *C    THESE COPYLIB CHANGES DEAL WITH NON-GOODYEAR OWNED MATERIALS
      *C    IN THE STOREROOM (ISC OWNED MATERIALS IN DANVILLE FOR EXAMPLE).
      *C
